(Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) Architecture Overview) '
(Page 1) '
() '
(Retrieval-Augmented Generation combines an external knowledge retriever with an LLM.) '
(By retrieving relevant passages before generation, RAG reduces hallucinations and grounds claims in real documents.) '
(Dense vector search is effective for semantic matching, but struggles on rare tokens and acronyms.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
