(Hybrid Retrieval with BM25 and Reciprocal Rank Fusion \(RRF\)) '
(Page 2) '
() '
(Lexical search using BM25Okapi indexes exact term frequencies and document lengths.) '
(Reciprocal Rank Fusion combines vector search and BM25 search rankings without needing raw score normalization.) '
(The RRF formula is 1 / \(k + rank\), where k=60 is standard.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
