(Cross-Encoder Reranking and Latency Evaluation) '
(Page 3) '
() '
(Cross-Encoders perform joint attention over the question and passage pair.) '
(This improves ranking precision and MRR at the cost of higher latency.) '
(On a 16 GB RAM laptop, a compact model like cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 balances accuracy and speed.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
