(Citation Provenance and Evidence Integrity) '
(Page 4) '
() '
(Citations must be synthesized directly from chunk metadata \(source filename and page number\).) '
(The system must never rely on LLM hallucinations for page citations.) '
(When documents lack sufficient evidence, the assistant states that the supplied documents do not provide enough evidence.) '
ET
endstream
